  "text": "Home\nAbout\nProducts\nIoT\nServices\nCareer\nContact\nBulk SMS\nHomeBulk SMS\nBulk SMS for Business\nSMS PACKAGE & PRICE\n#\tSMS QUANTITY\tNON MASKING SMS PRICE/SMS\tTOTAL\tVALIDITY\tMASKING SMS PRICE/SMS\tTOTAL\tVALIDITY\n1\t5000\t0.45\t2250\t1 Year\t0.65\t3250\t1 Year\n2\t10000\t0.37\t3700\t1 Year\t0.60\t6000\t1 Year\n3\t20000\t0.35\t7000\t1 Year\t0.57\t11400\t1 Year\n4\t50000\t0.33\t16500\t1 Year\t0.55\t27500\t1 Year\n5\t100000\t0.31\t31000\t1 Year\t0.53\t53000\t1 Year\n6\t500000\t0.30\t150000\t1 Year\t0.51\t255000\t1 Year\nTERMS & CONDITION\n\nAll prices are tax, vat and SD charge excluded. Masking Name Registration Cost: 5000 Taka(One Time).\n\nSMS marketing requirement:\nMasking / Sender name / Phone no(11 characters)\nSMS text (160 characters)\nSMS text character limit:\nEnglish SMS:\n1-160 characters- 1 SMS, 161-300 characters- 2 SMS, 301-440 characters- 3 SMS\nBangla SMS:\nA single SMS supports up to 70 characters. If your message exceeds this limit, it will be split into multiple SMS segments, with each additional segment allowing up to 67 characters. For example, a message that spans two segments can contain up to (67+67) = 134 characters in total.\nWhat you will get in report?\nAll number with delivery report (2 number will replaced by XY)\nUndelivered report\nFailed Report\nPayment Procedure:\n100 % advance payment\nPayment will goes to “Suffix IT Limited” account pay check or cash.\n\nWe maintain strategic partnerships with multiple organizations in Bangladesh and worldwide, working together to deliver high-quality solutions and long-term value.\n\nCONTACT US\n\nCha-70,70/A, Rupayan Millennium Square (9A), Progoti Sharoni, North Badda, Gulshan, Dhaka-1212.\n\ninfo@suffixit.com\n\n+88 01958 424000\n\nQUICK LINKS\nAbout Us\nCareer\nContact Us\n\n© 2026 All Rights Reserved by Suffix IT Limited",
